    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1717">

                <pb facs="1097" n="981" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg981"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 850d.00/327.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Schmedeman to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 29, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>It is understood that conference will adjourn tomorrow, without having signed any
                    acts. Russian delegates appear to have received instructions today not to sign
                    separate arbitration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schmedeman</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
